<title>INDIA: India RBI lowers repo auction cut-off to 4.90 pct.</title>
<headline>India RBI lowers repo auction cut-off to 4.90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it lowered the cut-off rate to 4.90 percent at its four-day repo auction of government securities from 5.0 percent at the last auction.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 49 bids for 76.65 billion rupees, of which it accpeted 20 for 15.20 billion.  </p>
<p>The weighted average repos rate was 4.8296 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
